o dispatched envoys Zaosi and Woyue to Wang Qi, the Cao Wei Governor of You Province, to report their ‘state of mutual attack.’ The actual power of Kunu was held by the official ‘Kukochihiko,’ establishing a political structure where ‘a man reigned as king while a powerful minister governed.’","jp":"勾努国の王。勾努国は邪馬台国（女王卑弥呼が統治）と長年にわたり不和であった。正始八年、両国の間で衝突が勃発すると、卑弥呼は使者の載斯や烏越を曹魏の幽州太守・王頎のもとへ派遣し、「相攻撃する状」を訴え出た。勾努国の実権は官吏の「狗古智卑狗」が掌握しており、「男子を王とし、権臣が政を補佐する」政治構造を形成していた。","kr":"구노국의 국왕입니다. 구노국은 야마타이국(여왕 비미호가 통치)과 오랫동안 불화했습니다. 정시 8년, 양국 간에 충돌이 발생하자 비미호는 사신 재사와 오월을 파견하여 조위의 유주태수 왕기에게 '서로 공격하는 상황'을 호소했습니다. 구노국의 실권은 관리 '구고지비구'가 장악하여 '남자가 왕이 되고 권신이 정사를 보좌하는' 정치 구조를 형성했습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1054615","remark":"普武","surname":"","surnameTc":"","surnameEn":"","surnameJp":"","surnameKr":"","surnameOther":"","name":"卑弥弓呼","nameTc":"卑彌弓呼","nameEn":"Himikoko","nameJp":"卑弥弓呼","nameKr":"히미코코","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"卑弥弓呼","power":"","rejectPower":"WJ11050","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1066","gender":"0","rule":"68","force":"55","wise":"65","politics":"70","charm":"75","will":"69","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"7","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"9","charmTalent":"9","willTalent":"8","weaponMaster":"29/27/55/27/25/28/31/26","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"1001105","warSoulPoint":"4000","battleSoulPoint":"3100","debateSoulPoint":"3300","strategy":"","strategy2":"1000505","professions":"2/1/1/2/3/4/3/1/3/2/2/1/1/2/2/2/2/1/2/2/2/3/2/3","attribute2":"85/85/89/89/90/93","morality":"2","compatible":"40","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","evaluate":"-3000","title":"","rank":"9","birth"